Solution: "Pivot" the data to create a `year` column:


::: {.cell layout-align="center"}

```{.r .cell-code}
population_tidy <- population_messy |>
  pivot_longer(
    cols = `2020`:`2022`,
    names_to = "year",
    values_to = "population"
  )

population_tidy |> gt()
```

