If you only want to keep the new columns (discarding all others), use `transmute()`:


::: {.cell layout-align="center"}

```{.r .cell-code}
experiments |>
  transmute(
    sample_id,  # Keep this column
    log_expression = log2(expression),
    normalized = expression / cell_count * 1000
  )
```

