  distinct(treatment, late_replicate = replicate > 2)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
<div class="kable-table">

|treatment |late_replicate |
|:---------|:--------------|
|control   |FALSE          |
|control   |TRUE           |
|drug_A    |FALSE          |
|drug_A    |TRUE           |
|drug_B    |FALSE          |
|drug_B    |TRUE           |

</div>
